+// Sibling EXL3 Dense Kernels for Kimi-K3.1-Pro (sm_80 + sm_120, PP-safe, SM-count-driven).
+// Existing Qwen/DeepSeek dense_mma.cu and dense_prefill_tc.cu stay completely untouched.
+//
+// Decode (1..32 rows, 2 launches total: input + fused Stream-K/Exact-Split MMA & H128 output):
+//   1) k31_decode_input_multi_kernel:
+//      - 1 warp per (row, member, bk), zeros per-workspace arrival_buf[0..total_out_blocks-1]
+//        on blockIdx.y == 0 (zero device globals, 100% concurrent-stream & CUDA Graph safe),
+//        zero stack frame, coalesced uint2 stores into [member, step, NT, 32] uint2 B-fragments.
+//   2) k31_decode_streamk_fused_kernel (8 warps = 256 threads, 128 output cols/CTA):
+//      - NT<=2 (M=1..16): 2 groups x MT=4 (768B/stage, 6 full cache lines) x kw=4 warps/group,
+//        4-stage cp.async ring pipelining BOTH weights (cp.async.cg 16B) and activations
+//        (cp.async.ca 8B), contiguous K-tile loops at half-bk (4-K-tile) granularity (ZERO
+//        k&7 branches, ZERO __syncthreads() in K-loop!).
+//      - NT>=3 (M=17..32): 4 groups x MT=2 (384B/stage) x kw=2 warps/group (0 spills, <=44 KB SMEM).
+//      - SM-count-driven grid selector (74/106/108/122/126 SMs & 188-SM sm_120), with optional
+//        VLLM_K31_DENSE_REF_SMS env override (or set_ref_sms_k31) so unequal SM-count TP ranks
+//        share the exact same split count and produce bitwise-identical replicated outputs.
+//      - Fused H128 + svh + BF16/FP32 output epilogue: zero partial buffer traffic for unsplit
+//        blocks; lock-free collision-free partial_buf + per-workspace arrival counter
+//        with STRICTLY FIXED-ORDER sequential split reduction across all M=1..16 (zero atomicAdd
+//        float drift -> 100% bitwise identical across replays and across M=1..16!).
+//      - <= 45 KB SMEM across ALL K5/K6/K7 & NT=1..4 (well under sm_120's 99 KB limit),
+//        ZERO register spills, ZERO stack frames, ZERO FP64, 100% CUDA Graph safe.
+//
+// Prefill (>32 rows, e.g. M=2048):
+//   - H128(x * suh) -> BF16 [M, K_pad]
+//   - 100%-coalesced warp-tiled EXL3 mul1 trellis core dequant -> row-major [K_pad, N_chunk] BF16
+//   - cuBLAS BF16 Tensor Core GEMM (at::mm_out with FP32 reduction enforced via ATen context guard)
+//   - H128(Y_h) * svh -> direct store into out[:, off : off + logical_out].
+#include "dense_k31.h"
+
+#include <ATen/ATen.h>
+#include <ATen/Context.h>
+#include <ATen/cuda/CUDAContext.h>
+#include <c10/cuda/CUDAException.h>
