+"""CPU unit tests for Kimi K3.1 FP32 head_dtype support and DSparkSuffixHybrid
+zero-sync startup + periodic telemetry logging.
+
+Covers:
+  1. KimiK3ForConditionalGeneration propagating outer hf_config.head_dtype to
+     text_config without clobbering an explicit text_config.head_dtype.
+  2. Exl3HeadLogitsProcessor._apply_head honoring BF16/FP32 head_dtype via
+     out_dtype override across mismatched method.out_dtype (both directions)
+     and rejecting unsupported dtypes such as float16.
+  3. K31DenseLinearMethod.apply(..., out_dtype=torch.float32) and
+     dense.unsupported_reason(..., torch.float32) is None on the tiny k31q
+     checkpoint (both K31DenseLauncher decode path and EXL3 fallback path).
+  4. DSparkSuffixHybridMixin startup logger.info, periodic CPU telemetry
+     counting hits/slots/max_match_len, adaptive_k.log_interval pickup, dummy
+     call exclusion, and CUDA non-blocking async staging/polling state machine.
+"""
+
