+
+Covers:
+  - Default VLLM_K31_P2P_ALLREDUCE=0 leaves K3.1 model calling standard TP
+    all-reduce unchanged (zero P2P calls).
+  - VLLM_K31_P2P_ALLREDUCE=1 at tp=2 intercepts attention o_proj (both KDA
+    and MLA/DSA) and Layer 0 dense MLP down_proj, and merges routed + shared
+    MoE partials + RMSNorm(3584) into ONE p2p_moe_dual_reduce_rmsnorm call
+    inside LatentMoERunner (2 P2P calls per MoE layer instead of 3 TP
+    all-reduces + 1 RMSNorm), with bitwise-equal rank0/rank1 outputs matching
+    the unmerged reference across M = 1, 4, 8, 16, 64, 256.
+  - Fallback paths: tp=1, tp=4, M > VLLM_K31_P2P_MAX_ROWS, unsupported device
+    capability, absent library, and verify_peer_transport failure (asymmetric
+    BAR1 failure -> automatic SHM fallback; total failure -> clean disable).
+  - PP-stage isolation (pp_rank=0..3 get distinct shm_names and handles).
+  - build_info / api_version >= 1 validation and build_p2p_standalone --arch-list.
