+"""K3.1 Lever 3 Phase C: PipeSpec PP overlap and KDA Bank-0/Bank-1 tests.
+
+Covers:
+1. Switch-off identity (VLLM_K31_PIPESPEC=0 == unchanged k31-main).
+2. Chunk-k resolution and constraints (2*k + 1 <= K, adaptive_k tier snapping).
+3. PPHandler wire formats N / A / B, dropped Chunk B, early B claim, P2 stash.
+4. Multi-stage EngineCore PP=2 and PP=4 emulation (valid epochs, partial A,
+   bonus mismatch, waiting admission deferral, Adaptive-K confidence gating).
+5. Bit-exact KDA Bank-0 / Bank-1 conv_state + recurrent_state isolation and
+   rollback across valid B, dropped B after partial A, and dropped B after
+   full A bonus mismatch.
+6. Runner PipeSpec state machine (valid A context-KV sync, B arming +
+   DraftLogitsCache shift, dropped B skip, aborted A-without-B draft restore).
+
+CPU only.
