+  ``decode``       the compiled Marlin decode (``VLLM_AMPERE_MARLIN_DECODE_CUDA``)
+  ``prefill``      the split-block Marlin prefill (``VLLM_AMPERE_MARLIN_PREFILL_WIDE``,
+                   ``VLLM_AMPERE_MARLIN_PREFILL_NARROW``) and its compiled PP
